    "detailed_description": "DAMA GALLERIA<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a short time, we were transported into something totally unique and new, something that allowed us to see and enjoy things differently.<br />\r\nNew technologies have given us different ways of seeing things, and art has changed because of them and with them<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDAMA is one among these new visions, when what is in front of us is no longer so tangible, we are transported into a new experience that tries to give what art conveys about us in the real world<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDAMA is also a world where the sensations are totally different but also totally unique to create a hybrid of what we feel and experience through our own arbitrariness<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDAMA is a digital space where the visitor can experience what the artists want to communicate with their works that encompass what we look, feel and perceive, leaving the viewer free to understand what they really want to tell us<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnter this micro-universe that is being updated with its new &quot;Season 2222&quot; which is bringing with it many new features and more artists from all over the world<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to DAMAWORLD <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave Fun :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf interested in some of the artworks write to dama.galleria@gmail.com or DM dama.galleria on Instragam",
